(text "Design target: 10-15V input (13.5V nominal), 5V / 2A output\nU1: nominal 580kHz; pulse skipping reduces frequency at light load\nVOUT = 0.768 x (1 + 54.9k / 10k) = 4.984V" (at 40.64 147.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "caf3f6f9-ef25-5ed3-b277-c0d5776f4113"))
(text "C1/C2 and C5/C6: X7R 1210 for voltage / DC-bias margin\nC4 is connected between BST and SW, never to ground\nPrototype: no physical testing; see README for open verification items" (at 40.64 165.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "06821436-9174-5333-b42e-0fcfc8f96cf5"))
